# Quirk Systems organization canon and shared workflow spine.
#
# The catch-all below already covers every path. The entries under it are not
# redundant to GitHub — the last matching rule wins — but they are redundant to
# a reader while one person owns everything. They are kept as a map of the
# surfaces that exist, so that splitting ownership later is an edit rather than
# an inventory. Add a path here when a directory is added at the root.
* @bryansayler

# Canonical state and governance.
/.quirk/ @bryansayler
/docs/ @bryansayler
/profile/ @bryansayler
/datasets/ @bryansayler

# Shared GitHub defaults.
/.github/workflows/ @bryansayler
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/ @bryansayler
/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md @bryansayler
/.github/copilot-instructions.md @bryansayler
/.github/dependabot.yml @bryansayler
/.github/release-drafter.yml @bryansayler
/.github/labeler.yml @bryansayler
/.github/zizmor.yml @bryansayler

# Executable governance and reusable agent assets.
/scripts/ @bryansayler
/tests/ @bryansayler
/prompt-packs/ @bryansayler
/agents/ @bryansayler
/templates/ @bryansayler
/.github/skills/ @bryansayler
/.claude/ @bryansayler

# Instruction surfaces every agent reads first.
/AGENTS.md @bryansayler
/CLAUDE.md @bryansayler
